            "text01": {
              "en": "Advanced Manufacturing & Quality Control"
            },
            "text02": {
              "en": "Our 5,000m² facility houses 210+ precision CNC machines and automated production lines. Every connector undergoes rigorous testing in our IEC-compliant QC laboratory."
